  "description": {
   "en": "In a world where the walking dead - known as Jiangshi - have become integrated into human society, protagonist Yintao's parents are murdered by a mysterious Jiangshi named Maomei.\nBy an inexplicable twist of fate, Yintao ends up living together with Maomei.\nWhat secrets lie behind their origins and this mysterious world?\n\n(Source: MangaPlus)",
   "ja": "人間の生活に、動く死体・キョンシーが根付いた世界。\n両親を謎のキョンシー・マオメイに殺された主人公・インタオは、何の因果かマオメイとともに生活をともにすることに。\n両者の出生と、世界に隠された秘密とは…？"
  },
